<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>LongCat-AudioDiT Diffusers Implementation Guide for SynthaEngine</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      color-scheme: light dark;
      --bg: #f7f8f8;
      --fg: #15191d;
      --muted: #5b6570;
      --line: #d9dedf;
      --panel: #ffffff;
      --panel-2: #edf1f2;
      --accent: #0f766e;
      --accent-2: #7c2d12;
      --code-bg: #111827;
      --code-fg: #f8fafc;
    }

    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
      :root {
        --bg: #101416;
        --fg: #e9eef0;
        --muted: #a8b3ba;
        --line: #313c41;
        --panel: #171d20;
        --panel-2: #20292d;
        --accent: #5eead4;
        --accent-2: #fdba74;
      }
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--fg);
      font-family: "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.58;
    }

    main {
      max-width: 1120px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 36px 20px 64px;
    }

    header {
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding: 20px 0 24px;
    }

    h1,
    h2,
    h3 {
      letter-spacing: 0;
      line-height: 1.18;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.3rem);
    }

    h2 {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      margin: 36px 0 14px;
      padding-top: 28px;
      font-size: 1.55rem;
    }

    h3 {
      margin: 26px 0 10px;
      font-size: 1.15rem;
    }

    p,
    ul,
    ol,
    table,
    pre {
      margin: 0 0 18px;
    }

    ul,
    ol {
      padding-left: 1.35rem;
    }

    a {
      color: var(--accent);
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }

    code {
      font-family: "Cascadia Code", Consolas, monospace;
      font-size: 0.94em;
    }

    :not(pre) > code {
      background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 12%, transparent);
      border-radius: 4px;
      padding: 0.08rem 0.28rem;
    }

    pre {
      background: var(--code-bg);
      border-radius: 8px;
      color: var(--code-fg);
      overflow-x: auto;
      padding: 16px;
    }

    pre code {
      display: block;
      background: transparent;
      color: inherit;
      line-height: 1.55;
      white-space: pre;
    }

    table {
      border-collapse: collapse;
      display: block;
      overflow-x: auto;
      width: 100%;
    }

    th,
    td {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding: 9px 11px;
      text-align: left;
      vertical-align: top;
    }

    th {
      background: var(--panel-2);
    }

    .lede {
      max-width: 850px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 1.08rem;
    }

    .meta {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-top: 18px;
    }

    .pill {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--panel);
      color: var(--muted);
      padding: 6px 10px;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 14px;
      margin: 18px 0;
    }

    .card {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: var(--panel);
      padding: 14px;
    }

    .card strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .note {
      border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
      background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 10%, transparent);
      padding: 12px 14px;
    }

    .warn {
      border-left-color: var(--accent-2);
      background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent-2) 12%, transparent);
    }

    @media (max-width: 780px) {
      .grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <header>
      <h1>LongCat-AudioDiT Diffusers Implementation Guide</h1>
      <p class="lede">Step-by-step research note for adding Meituan LongCat-AudioDiT to SynthaEngine as a new workflow-first text-to-audio feature.</p>
      <div class="meta">
        <span class="pill">Date: 2026-05-30</span>
        <span class="pill">Pipeline: LongCatAudioDiTPipeline</span>
        <span class="pill">Task: text-to-audio</span>
        <span class="pill">Target PC: RTX 3060 12 GB, 64 GB RAM</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section>
      <h2>Executive Summary</h2>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="card">
          <strong>What This Is</strong>
          <p>LongCat-AudioDiT is a text-conditioned audio diffusion model. Diffusers exposes it through <code>LongCatAudioDiTPipeline</code> for mono waveform generation.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <strong>Local Feasibility</strong>
          <p>The 1B Diffusers-format checkpoint is plausible locally for short clips with FP16/BF16, one output per job, subprocess execution, and offload fallback.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <strong>Implementation Shape</strong>
          <p>Add a new <code>longcat-audiodit.text2audio</code> workflow task and a first-class audio output contract instead of reusing image/video output keys.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="note">No existing application files were changed by this guide. The implementation plan below is intended for a future additive code change.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>What This Is</h2>
      <p>LongCat-AudioDiT uses a waveform VAE plus a diffusion transformer. Text is encoded with a UMT5 text encoder, the transformer denoises audio latents, and the VAE decodes those latents into mono 24 kHz audio.</p>
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Area</th>
            <th>Detail</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Main task</td><td>Text to audio</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Diffusers class</td><td><code>LongCatAudioDiTPipeline</code></td></tr>
          <tr><td>Denoiser</td><td><code>LongCatAudioDiTTransformer</code></td></tr>
          <tr><td>Audio VAE</td><td><code>LongCatAudioDiTVae</code></td></tr>
          <tr><td>Text encoder</td><td><code>UMT5EncoderModel</code></td></tr>
          <tr><td>Scheduler</td><td><code>FlowMatchEulerDiscreteScheduler</code></td></tr>
          <tr><td>Output</td><td>Mono waveform, typically saved as WAV</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <h3>Canonical Diffusers Usage</h3>
      <pre><code class="language-python">import soundfile as sf
import torch
from diffusers import LongCatAudioDiTPipeline

pipeline = LongCatAudioDiTPipeline.from_pretrained(
    "ruixiangma/LongCat-AudioDiT-1B-Diffusers",
    torch_dtype=torch.float16,
)
pipeline = pipeline.to("cuda")

audio = pipeline(
    "A calm ocean wave ambience with soft wind in the background.",
    audio_duration_s=5.0,
    num_inference_steps=16,
    guidance_scale=4.0,
    generator=torch.Generator("cuda").manual_seed(42),
).audios[0, 0]

sf.write("longcat.wav", audio, pipeline.sample_rate)</code></pre>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Modalities</h2>
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Modality or sub-pipeline</th>
            <th>Available in Diffusers?</th>
            <th>Implementation note</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Text to audio</td><td>Yes</td><td>Use <code>LongCatAudioDiTPipeline</code>.</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Text to speech</td><td>Yes, via text-to-audio</td><td>Pipeline outputs waveform audio.</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Negative prompt / CFG</td><td>Yes</td><td><code>negative_prompt</code> and <code>guidance_scale</code>.</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Duration control</td><td>Yes</td><td><code>audio_duration_s</code>.</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Voice cloning</td><td>No</td><td>Reference repo has scripts; Diffusers pipeline does not expose prompt audio.</td></tr>
          <tr><td>APG guidance</td><td>No</td><td>Reference repo concept, not current Diffusers call option.</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Image/video generation</td><td>No</td><td>This architecture is audio-only.</td></tr>
          <tr><td>LoRA</td><td>Not documented</td><td>Keep out of first SynthaEngine implementation.</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Local Feasibility</h2>
      <p>The 1B Diffusers-format package is around 5.31 GB on disk and the current virtual environment imports the pipeline successfully. This makes short local clips realistic, but not a promise of fast production throughput.</p>
      <pre><code class="language-text">torch=2.10.0+cu128
diffusers=0.38.0
transformers=5.8.0
accelerate=1.13.0
bitsandbytes=0.49.2
torchao=NOT_AVAILABLE
gguf=NOT_AVAILABLE
soundfile=NOT_AVAILABLE
scipy=AVAILABLE
torchaudio=AVAILABLE
cuda_available=True
cuda_device=NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060
bf16_supported=True
total_vram_gb=12.00</code></pre>

      <h3>Yes Path</h3>
      <pre><code class="language-json">{
  "model": "LongCat-AudioDiT-1B-Diffusers",
  "audio_duration_s": 5.0,
  "steps": 16,
  "guidance_scale": 4.0,
  "seed": 42,
  "num_audios": 1,
  "precision": "fp16",
  "memory_preset": "cuda",
  "quantization": "none"
}</code></pre>

      <h3>No Path</h3>
      <p class="note warn">Do not treat the 3.5B reference checkpoint, voice cloning, long clips, multi-output batches, or production hot-pipeline serving as default local features on an RTX 3060 12 GB.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Quantization</h2>
      <p>Quantization is possible to investigate with Diffusers pipeline quantization. Start with bitsandbytes because it is installed locally. Treat the result as experimental until quality and memory are measured.</p>
      <pre><code class="language-python">import torch
from diffusers import LongCatAudioDiTPipeline
from diffusers.quantizers import PipelineQuantizationConfig

quant_config = PipelineQuantizationConfig(
    quant_backend="bitsandbytes_8bit",
    quant_kwargs={"load_in_8bit": True},
    components_to_quantize=["transformer", "text_encoder"],
)

pipe = LongCatAudioDiTPipeline.from_pretrained(
    "ruixiangma/LongCat-AudioDiT-1B-Diffusers",
    torch_dtype=torch.float16,
    quantization_config=quant_config,
)
pipe.enable_model_cpu_offload()</code></pre>

      <pre><code class="language-python">quant_config = PipelineQuantizationConfig(
    quant_backend="bitsandbytes_4bit",
    quant_kwargs={
        "load_in_4bit": True,
        "bnb_4bit_quant_type": "nf4",
        "bnb_4bit_compute_dtype": torch.float16,
    },
    components_to_quantize=["transformer", "text_encoder"],
)</code></pre>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Cloud Options</h2>
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Provider</th>
            <th>Good fit</th>
            <th>GPU target</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Hugging Face Inference Endpoints</td><td>Managed production API</td><td>24 GB+ for comfort, 40 GB+ for heavier tests</td></tr>
          <tr><td>RunPod Pods</td><td>Manual experiments</td><td>RTX 4090, A40, A100</td></tr>
          <tr><td>RunPod Serverless</td><td>Queue-backed API</td><td>24 GB+</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Vast.ai</td><td>Low-cost rentals</td><td>RTX 4090, L40/L40S, A40, A100</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Lambda Cloud</td><td>Standard GPU VM</td><td>A100 40/80 GB, H100</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Modal</td><td>Python-first serverless GPU</td><td>A10G/A100/H100</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Replicate custom model</td><td>Hosted model API</td><td>A40/A100/H100 class</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Implementation Plan</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>Add a new <code>longcat-audiodit</code> model family and <code>longcat-audiodit.text2audio</code> task.</li>
        <li>Add <code>AudiosWithBatchOutput</code> and return <code>{ "batch_id": "...", "audios": ["/outputs/...wav"] }</code>.</li>
        <li>Add WAV history support with <code>media_type="audio"</code> and an <code>audio_&lt;batch_id&gt;.wav.json</code> sidecar.</li>
        <li>Add <code>LongCatAudioDiTText2AudioInputs</code> with prompt, negative prompt, duration, steps, guidance, seed, model, precision, memory preset, quantization, and WAV output format.</li>
        <li>Add <code>backend/longcat_audiodit/pipeline.py</code> and <code>subprocess_runner.py</code> using the existing one-shot subprocess lifecycle.</li>
        <li>Add a workflow adapter in <code>backend/workflow/longcat_audiodit.py</code>.</li>
        <li>Register the task in workflow input/output maps and the task registry.</li>
        <li>Extend catalog capabilities with a <code>text2audio</code> feature flag and UI hints.</li>
        <li>Add frontend files under <code>frontend/longcat_audiodit/</code> plus a reusable audio gallery component.</li>
        <li>Update <code>docs/WORKFLOW_API.md</code>, <code>docs/PIPELINE_LIFECYCLE.md</code>, and <code>docs/ARCHITECTURE.md</code>.</li>
        <li>Add focused workflow, pipeline, frontend, catalog, and history tests.</li>
        <li>Run backend compile, focused tests, and one real 5 second FP16 smoke test.</li>
      </ol>

      <h3>Input Schema Sketch</h3>
      <pre><code class="language-python">class LongCatAudioDiTText2AudioInputs(BaseModel):
    prompt: str = ""
    negative_prompt: str = ""
    audio_duration_s: float = Field(default=5.0, ge=0.5, le=30.0)
    steps: int = Field(default=16, ge=1, le=100)
    guidance_scale: float = Field(default=4.0, ge=0.0, le=30.0)
    seed: int | None = None
    model: str | None = None
    num_audios: int = Field(default=1, ge=1, le=1)
    precision: Literal["fp16", "bf16"] = "fp16"
    memory_preset: Literal["cuda", "model_offload", "sequential_offload"] = "cuda"
    quantization: Literal["none", "bnb_8bit", "bnb_4bit"] = "none"
    output_format: Literal["wav"] = "wav"
    mono_to_stereo: bool = False
    execution_mode: Literal["subprocess"] = "subprocess"
    batch_id: str | None = None</code></pre>

      <h3>Workflow Payload</h3>
      <pre><code class="language-json">{
  "kind": "workflow",
  "payload": {
    "tasks": [
      {
        "id": "t1",
        "type": "longcat-audiodit.text2audio",
        "inputs": {
          "prompt": "A calm ocean wave ambience with soft wind in the background.",
          "audio_duration_s": 5.0,
          "steps": 16,
          "guidance_scale": 4.0,
          "seed": 42
        }
      }
    ],
    "return": "@t1.audios"
  }
}</code></pre>

      <h3>Runtime Loader Sketch</h3>
      <pre><code class="language-python">def load_text2audio_pipeline(model_name, *, precision, memory_preset, quantization):
    entry = _get_longcat_model_entry(model_name)
    source = resolve_model_source(entry)
    dtype = torch.bfloat16 if precision == "bf16" else torch.float16
    quantization_config = build_longcat_quantization_config(quantization)

    kwargs = {"torch_dtype": dtype, "low_cpu_mem_usage": True}
    if quantization_config is not None:
        kwargs["quantization_config"] = quantization_config

    pipe = LongCatAudioDiTPipeline.from_pretrained(source, **kwargs)

    if memory_preset == "cuda":
        pipe.to("cuda")
    elif memory_preset == "model_offload":
        pipe.enable_model_cpu_offload()
    elif memory_preset == "sequential_offload":
        pipe.enable_sequential_cpu_offload()
    else:
        raise ValueError(f"Unsupported LongCat memory_preset: {memory_preset}")

    cleanup_memory()
    return pipe</code></pre>
    </section>

